{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026d7mA4jcptq1794363397.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>TVB節目巡禮2027昨日（10日）隆重舉行，會上公布8大重點劇集名單，包括《驅魔速遞》、《超時空男臣II》、《警是個大佬》、《模仿人生》、《枱底》、《模範律師團》、《新聞女王III》以及首度推行的《金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳（豎屏短劇）》，強勁陣容隨即引爆全網熱議。</p><p><p><img alt=\"98b25b76-05a7-4061-98cf-f99af8ddaf19.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026HOCQ3TcvtO1794363398.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a0b13692-40c4-4abf-917a-d3a6af4335d9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026QTfZcSX6YD1794363397.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>在曝光的重磅劇集中，《枱底》憑藉金像獎名導麥兆輝首度踏足電視領域編導而備受矚目。該劇貫穿「枱面之上天堂，枱底之下地獄」的命題，將權力與欲望交織成暗黑生存遊戲，宣傳片中更穿插車禍與爆破等震撼場面，並由羅子溢、張振朗、陳展鵬及吳業坤四大實力派男神同場較勁。</p><p><p><img alt=\"def1e8f2-8905-4c33-b736-796f880ee723.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ZI3TQG8hqP1794363395.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f1628122-1ab0-4245-af52-b091075af5f6.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DhkVntahs91794363394.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"9629925d-bddf-43ab-99fa-5899231dff3c.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gKicF9sR4m1794363394.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>另一亮點《正義女神》衍生劇《模範律師團》同樣吸睛，三屆視帝羅嘉良以型爆律師造型回歸，在法庭上展現霸氣氣場，並與楊茜堯展開對白火花十足的激烈對決，加上埋屍等暗黑鏡頭及滕麗名、張曦雯、劉佩玥、何廣沛等陣容，期待值爆燈。</p><p><p><img alt=\"4334e048-d434-414f-91e6-1fdbd692b68d.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026BhGIOfhaji1794363396.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>至於繼前作橫掃《萬千星輝頒獎典禮》9大獎項後的《新聞女王III》亦載譽歸來，高海寧、李施嬅等原班人馬強勢回歸，宣傳片結尾更響起佘詩曼「Man姐」的招牌留言聲線：「我係文慧心，請你留低你嘅電話，我會盡快覆你……」，瞬間將期待感拉滿。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.606519+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":481,"images":7,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T02:17:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T11:10:23.684245+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T03:04:37.830717+00:00","content_hash":"3cfc8356e99908816de78b45da576118a8ceb4b7d32a93ef918922080ea0e253","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-11T03:11:11.606519+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}